# Project: PRJEB7934
# This dataset contains sequencing reads for DNA ligands selected using novel consecutive affinity-purification SELEX assay.
# Here we have used this CAP-SELEX method identify pairs of transcription factors (TFs) that bind cooperatively to DNA 
# and to characterize the DNA sequences recognized by these complexes. 
# 
# Study includes also regular HT-SELEX experiments that have been run for validation of individual TF specificities, 
# in these cases the field of the second TF name has been replaced with an text “htSELEX”. Filenames are composed 
# of following fields that have been separated with underscore "_" symbols. 
# 1) Name of the TF1 2) TF2 name 3) Selection cycle of the experiment 4) Experimental batch 
# 5) “Barcode”, 6+3 bases that flank the 40N randomized region For example: GLI3_SOX17_3_AAA_TAAACA40NCAA Or TBX3_htSELEX_1_AR_TAAGCC40NAGT

